'''Vs Kaoru Hanayama''' (VS花山薫, ''VS Hanayama Kaoru'', '''VS Kaoru Hanayama''') is a [[Baki Hanma Collaboration Event|Hanma Baki: Son of Ogre]] collaboration stage added in the [[Version 14.3 Update]]. The boss of this Gauntlet is [[Kaoru Hanayama (Enemy)|Kaoru Hanayama]].

==Overview==
===About===
Vs Kaoru Hanayama contains a total of 10 [[No Continues]] levels, called '''We're Still Doing This? Lvs'''. After beating three stages, the player must wait for 90 minutes before they may proceed to the next one (30 minutes for one available). Rewards for the first completion of a We're Still Doing This? Lvs. can include XP and Legend Dumbbells. The rewards reset with every appearance of the event.

===Stage Battlegrounds===
:''See [[Vs Kaoru Hanayama/We're Still Doing This? Lv.1~10]].''

==Play Requirements==
*Vs Kaoru Hanayama is unlocked after clearing [[Empire of Cats]] Chapter 3.

